# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

Lists the names of every KinD cluster on the machine, whether or not Terraform
created them. This is the same set `kind get clusters` reports.

Use it to make a configuration conditional on an existing cluster, or to assert
in CI that a previous run cleaned up after itself.

